{%- comment -%}
  Furgenics — competitor-price snippet
  Renders a competitor's published price with an explicit as-of date so
  staleness is always visible to the reader and to maintainers.

  We do NOT auto-pull competitor prices — they are hand-captured in
  competitor-intel.md and copied here. Quarterly refresh is the expected
  cadence; see knowledge/content-style-guide.md for the maintenance rhythm.

  Usage:
    {% render 'competitor-price',
        brand: 'FURminator',
        product: 'Anti-Shed Conditioner',
        price: '$89.01',
        currency: 'USD',
        as_of: '2026-04',
        source: 'Amazon' %}

  Parameters:
    brand     (string)   Competitor brand name. Required.
    product   (string)   Product name / SKU descriptor. Required.
    price     (string)   Price as displayed, including symbol. Required. e.g. '$89.01'.
    currency  (string)   Currency code. Optional, default 'USD'.
    as_of     (string)   YYYY-MM date the price was captured. Required.
    source    (string)   Where the price was captured. Optional. e.g. 'Amazon', 'Brand site'.

  Returns:
    A <span class="competitor-price"> containing the brand, product, price,
    and an inline as-of annotation.

  Class-A note: any update to a competitor price flows through competitor-intel.md
  first (the source of truth), then to the page using this snippet. Don't change
  the snippet body without updating the content-style-guide.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign _currency = currency | default: 'USD' -%}

<span class="competitor-price" data-brand="{{ brand | escape }}" data-as-of="{{ as_of }}">
  {{ brand }} {{ product }}:
  <strong class="competitor-price-value">{{ price }} {{ _currency }}</strong>
  <span class="competitor-price-asof" title="Captured {{ as_of }}{% if source %} from {{ source }}{% endif %}">
    <small>(as of {{ as_of }}{% if source %}, {{ source }}{% endif %})</small>
  </span>
</span>
